    "summary": "Adherence, functional coverage and conventions make a notes-only chunk call in a divided review (adapters/code-review-chunk.ts, kind 'notes'): schema { notes: [{ key, atomIds, note }] }, no findings field. validate rejects unknown keys and atoms outside the call with one fixed-size reason per kind: a model-made value is located by count and position, never quoted back (fix 581e1d76), so the correction always fits beside the call and is always sent; tested with keys and ids twice the limit long (the re-issue carries the correction and fits). gather.notesFrom is wired through each dimension's gather plan (t4).",
